{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07670","headline":"送妻 · 杨志坚","name":"送妻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生志业在琴诗，头上如今有二丝。\n渔父尚知谿谷暗，山妻不信出身迟。\n荆钗任意撩新鬓，明镜从他别画眉。\n今日便同行路客，相逢即是下山时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨志坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}